    813  2638							; Enemies: half of them each frame (even slots on even frames, odd slots on
    814  2638							; odd frames), so each moves in steps of two frames. Each walks left at its
    815  2638							; kind's pace; a toy in its way stops it and gets chewed, except: the
    816  2638							; helicopter hops over the first toy, the pogo frog jumps to the next shelf
    817  2638							; once, the balloon clown floats over every toy, the T-Rex crushes a toy in
    818  2638							; one bite. A lasso holds it; reaching the toy box is a breach.
